                <div class="content-text what-is-definition">
                    
                    <p>Two IP protections: Trademark (TM-A with Trademark Registry for brand name/logo/tagline in specific classes) + Copyright (Form XIV with Copyright Office for creative works: software, content, designs). For <a href="#">LLP Registration</a>, see our page.</p>
                    <p>Trademark search &rarr; class selection &rarr; filing &rarr; examination &rarr; publication (4 months) &rarr; registration. Copyright: automatic on creation but registration = prima facie evidence. For <a href="/income-tax-return">ITR Filing</a>, see our page.</p>

                </div>
                <div class="highlight-box" style="margin-top:20px;">
                    <p><strong>Key Terms for Brand Registration:</strong></p>
                    <ul><li><strong>TM-A:</strong> Trademark application on IP India. Rs 4,500 (DPIIT/MSME) or Rs 9,000/class. TM&trade; from filing</li><li><strong>45 Nice Classes:</strong> 1-34 goods, 35-45 services. Multi-class for broad protection. Wrong class = zero protection</li><li><strong>S9/S11 Objections:</strong> Descriptive/generic (S9) or conflicting mark (S11). Response within 30 days critical</li><li><strong>Copyright Form XIV:</strong> Software, literary, artistic, musical. Lifetime + 60 years. 2-3 months processing</li><li><strong>SIPP Scheme:</strong> DPIIT startups: 50% fee + govt bears facilitator fee. Trademark essentially free</li><li><strong>Word vs Device:</strong> Word mark (text, broadest) + device mark (logo, visual). File both for max protection</li></ul>

                </div>
            </div>
